{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_004_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fcf75292fe9ec092b516c40bb34852e8a82d182c1d23d5d99fe81a6b3e317d12",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d289218816bb6cc2d012fb32c165b71f5a95d856f2a36a231eb9b36c33024632",
      "text": "自从偶像出道后，\n每次来这店里我都会提起你呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d3e35ba710ce9801cecd7b1a6e08699a150f8e6b27c95e18f571c4fe8cda250",
      "text": "说你总是为了我们拼命努力，\n是个靠得住的好伙伴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f814bd29081f35107370fa23413eb47001f5969ad9776cb8a2503077902a056",
      "text": "确实正如辉先生所言呢。\n给您做西装可真让人充满干劲啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ef22c14938350fb10b5edb5cd7d6ec828963a73ab42e88cd177c35a3755531f",
      "text": "制作人，先来选面料吧！\n老爷子，有面料样册吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09f49e33d1e45c4e248b3a4ff36385d47703ca4eb7e4fe21bf82e3f508472e5a",
      "text": "好的，在这里。也有新款的面料哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10ee8390aa4f721567415e06cac7f32186e3cc632f703da014b4f39df52dea84",
      "text": "那可真让人期待！我来看看……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f9f5c6e17a99331b73c9a19a00a7ce48173b54d7ee74319f4efba60def9a528",
      "text": "噢噢，这个颜色不是挺好的吗？\n觉得怎么样，●●●●プロデューサー？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:334aa503ec90e7562ae8005311a4371810708e1f2af5a397843114811e35cad5",
      "text": "居然有这么多！光是选颜色都要纠结了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8bc3d66a12bfac79509428a31613160601883d81ba1cc8e5400978de3578c40",
      "text": "不光是颜色和花纹，按手感来挑也是一种方法哦。\n产地不同特征也不一样呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_004ter_01_1_2_004_01:1_2_004_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d904eb9ce7e961f4453b556e3ad47c9ffaf162d6d0d9a4ade600b87afd63fda",
      "text": "本店可以满足您的任何需求。\n面料和款式都可以慢慢考虑哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
